## Quickstart

```bash
mise install        # pins every tool this repo needs
mise run test
```

Common verbs (same in every project):

| verb            | does                          |
| --------------- | ----------------------------- |
| `mise run fmt`  | format                        |
| `mise run lint` | lint                          |
| `mise run test` | run the test suite            |
{% if use_podman %}
| `mise run up`   | start local services (podman) |
| `mise run down` | stop them                     |
{% endif %}
